```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph MD_Operations [Managing Director Interaction]
        A[Enter DPIK Tadbir] --> B{Select Action}
        B -->|Trigger Preset| C[Click Preset: What's new today?]
        B -->|Specific Query| D[AI Chat: Search / Summarize Topic]
        B -->|Review Projects| E[Open Project Register]
        B -->|Review Activity| F[View Daily/Weekly Rollups]
    end

    subgraph Outlook_MCP_Processor [On-Demand Outlook MCP Processor]
        C --> McpCall[AgentService: Invoke outlook_list_inbox_delta]
        D --> McpCall2[AgentService: Invoke outlook_search_mail]
        
        McpCall --> OutlookServer[outlook-mcp / Microsoft Graph API]
        McpCall2 --> OutlookServer
        
        OutlookServer -->|Concise Context JSON - Zero Raw Storage| LLM[LLM Synthesis Engine]
    end

    subgraph AI_Synthesis_And_Proposals [AI Synthesis & Proposal Generation]
        LLM --> Briefing[Render Executive Summary & Urgent Insights]
        
        LLM --> ActionCheck{Action Required?}
        ActionCheck -->|Draft / Reply / Forward| ActionCard[Generate Staged Action Card]
        ActionCheck -->|Project Commitments| RegCard[Generate Project Register Proposal]
        ActionCheck -->|Personal To-Dos| NoteCard[Generate Personal Note/Task Proposal]
    end

    subgraph Human_Confirmation [Human-in-the-Loop Confirmation Gate]
        ActionCard --> Approval{MD Confirmation}
        RegCard --> Approval
        NoteCard --> Approval
        
        Approval -->|Discard / Edit| Cancel[Refine / Discard]
        Approval -->|Approve & Dispatch| Execute[Execute Action via Graph API / DB]
    end

    subgraph Processed_Output_Storage [Stored Processed Memory Ledger]
        Execute --> DispatchOutbound[Dispatch Email via outlook_send_message / reply / forward]
        Execute --> SaveRegister[Save to project_registry_entries]
        Execute --> SaveNotes[Save to personal_notes / personal_tasks]
        
        DispatchOutbound --> Receipt[Commit to ai_action_receipts & AuditLog]
        SaveRegister --> Receipt
        SaveNotes --> Receipt
        
        Receipt --> CompoundingMemory[(Cumulative Project Context Knowledge Base)]
        Receipt --> RollupReports[(Rolling Daily & Weekly Activity Rollups)]
    end
```
